  "articleBody": "Create a workable in-law suite plan by defining how independently the occupant will live, checking the existing property conditions, and having a qualified remodeling team confirm design, permit, and construction requirements. Gather site information, identify privacy and accessibility priorities, decide which living functions belong in the suite, and request a written scope covering design, materials, approvals, construction, and final inspection.",
